mods/fleet-changes/main.js is adapted from threads/mods/t4-diff/main.js in
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-layout-examples, licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE-herdr-layout-examples beside this file).
Changed: it reads a fleet container's changes through the fleet CLI,
takes its colors from the theme, refreshes only while shown, parses one
patch, and shows every file as a card with a file tree beside it.

mods/fleet-agents/main.js is a clone of the agents mod, version 0.1.9,
that Herdr app ships (made with `herdr-app do mod.clone`), licensed under the Apache
License 2.0, the same text as LICENSE-herdr-layout-examples. Changed: a
container's row shows a PR #n pill read from its task directory, stopped
containers are listed under Stopped, and the sort menu opens this mod.

mods/fleet-tabs/main.js is a clone of the tabs mod, version 0.1.9, that
Herdr app ships (made with `herdr-app do mod.clone`), licensed under the
Apache License 2.0, the same text as LICENSE-herdr-layout-examples.
Changed: it has no Files button, and its Changes button switches the
work area to the Changes view for the active tab only.

